## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gargoyle
## Notes: Your guild's raids and signups in game (on the game's calendar too, with a heads-up about new raids and a reminder before raids you haven't signed up for), new raids for officers, your characters kept up to date on your Gargoyle account, and talent plans: the game's talent window marks the talents a build from your account still wants. Open it with the minimap button or /gargoyle. Each feature can be turned on or off in Options > AddOns > Gargoyle.
